# Installed Anser system: explicit functional choices, one package per line.
# Cenere and live-only tools are added to the generated ISO profile.
# Provided by current dependencies: diffutils, curl (libcurl), libasan,
# libubsan and poppler (pdftotext). Recheck when changing this selection.

